y","evidence_ids":["comparator_not_run_locally","extraction_not_run_locally","lean_build_not_run_locally","source_bytes_audited"],"id":"lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos249.PaperCompleteR21.balancedPulse_common_history","kind":"declaration","label":"ErdosProblems.Erdos249.PaperCompleteR21.balancedPulse_common_history","locator":"lean/ErdosProblems/Erdos249/PaperCompleteR21/CarryDescriptionInformationLoss.lean, line 93","source_id":"lean:ErdosProblems/Erdos249/PaperCompleteR21/CarryDescriptionInformationLoss.lean","statement":"theorem balancedPulse_common_history (m : ℕ) (hm : 2 ≤ m) (r : ℕ)\n    (hr : r ≤ balancedPulseRadius m) :\n    (∀ n : ℕ, n ≠ m → n ≠ m + 1 → balancedPulseCoeff m r n = 0)\n      ∧ balancedPulseCoeff m r m = balancedPulseRadius m - r\n      ∧ balancedPulseCoeff m r (m + 1) = 2 * r\n      ∧ (∀ n : ℕ, balancedPulseCoeff m r n ≤ n)\n      ∧ binaryCoeffSeries (balancedPulseCoeff m r)\n          = (balancedPulseRadius m : ℝ) / 2 ^ m\n      ∧ (∀ N : ℕ, N < m → binaryCoeffTail (balancedPulseCoeff m r) N\n          = (balancedPulseRadius m : ℝ) / 2 ^ (m - N))\n      ∧ binaryCoeffTail (balancedPulseCoeff m r) m = (r : ℝ)","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos249.PaperCompleteR21.balancedPulse_common_history","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.prop-local-void","id":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.prop-local-void%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos249.PaperCompleteR21.balancedPulse_common_history%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.prop-local-void%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos249.PaperCompleteR21.balancedPulse_common_history%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","